{%- comment -%}
  Peru BEYOND HAIR page — true copy/parity build of the official Montibello
  brand-manifesto page (https://hair.montibello.com/beyond-hair/), measured
  and transcribed live on 2026-09-28 at 1440px and 390px, not from memory.
  Single dedicated section for a single dedicated page
  (templates/page.beyond-hair.json), matching the montibello-education.liquid
  pattern used elsewhere in this theme: one section, copy carried in schema
  settings so it stays editable without touching markup.

  Hero: the Vimeo embed is domain-locked, so the hero plays the same film from
  Shopify Files (CDN): muted/looping/inline like the official background video,
  with a PLAY VIDEO trigger that opens the full video with sound in a modal.

  Official section order preserved: hero video → Manifesto → "Lo que
  ofrecemos" (5 pillars on the official wavy-hair texture) → community/salon
  locator → contact assistance CTA. Peru adaptations (per explicit task
  instruction, nothing else rewritten):
    - Education CTA points at the real Peru page (/pages/educacion), not the
      Spain URL.
    - Contact CTA points at the real Peru contact page (/pages/contact),
      which is also the destination the professional CTA already uses
      throughout this theme — left completely untouched by this task.
    - The official localizer button ("Localizador de centros") is omitted:
      Peru has no allied-store/salon locator destination yet, so the
      community section keeps its official image + heading but drops the
      dead CTA rather than link to the Spain-only locator or fake a
      directory that doesn't exist (task section 10, option A).
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="montibello-beyond-hair">

  {%- comment -%} HERO — official: 2500:1406 background video (autoplay, muted, loop, inline, no controls) with a centred PLAY VIDEO pill that opens the full video. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="montibello-beyond-hair__hero" aria-label="{{ section.settings.hero_heading | default: 'Beyond Hair' }}">
    <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__hero-frame">
      <video
        class="montibello-beyond-hair__hero-video"
        data-bh-video
        data-src480="{{ section.settings.video_480 }}"
        data-src720="{{ section.settings.video_720 }}"
        data-src1080="{{ section.settings.video_1080 }}"
        poster="{{ 'montibello-beyond-hair-video-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}"
        width="2136"
        height="1080"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="auto"
        aria-hidden="true"
        tabindex="-1"
      ></video>
      <button type="button" class="montibello-beyond-hair__play" data-bh-open aria-haspopup="dialog">
        <img src="{{ 'montibello-beyond-hair-play-icon.svg' | asset_url }}" width="10" height="11" alt="" loading="eager">
        <span>{{ section.settings.play_label | default: 'Play video' }}</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <dialog class="montibello-beyond-hair__modal" data-bh-modal aria-label="{{ section.settings.hero_heading | default: 'Beyond Hair' }}">
      <button type="button" class="montibello-beyond-hair__modal-close" data-bh-close aria-label="Cerrar">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><line fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" x1="1" y1="1" x2="13" y2="13"></line><line fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" x1="13" y1="1" x2="1" y2="13"></line></svg>
      </button>
      <video class="montibello-beyond-hair__modal-video" data-bh-modal-video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="{{ 'montibello-beyond-hair-video-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}"></video>
    </dialog>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} MANIFESTO — centered editorial copy, verbatim official Spanish text. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto">
    <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-inner">
      <h2 class="montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-heading">{{ section.settings.manifesto_heading | default: 'Manifesto' }}</h2>
      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-body">
        {% if section.settings.manifesto_p1 != blank %}<p>{{ section.settings.manifesto_p1 }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if section.settings.manifesto_p2 != blank %}<p>{{ section.settings.manifesto_p2 }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if section.settings.manifesto_p3 != blank %}<p>{{ section.settings.manifesto_p3 }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {% if section.settings.manifesto_closing != blank %}
        <p class="montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-closing">
          {% assign closing_lines = section.settings.manifesto_closing | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' %}
          {% for line in closing_lines %}{{ line | strip }}{% unless forloop.last %}<br>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} LO QUE OFRECEMOS — 5 pillars over the official wavy-hair texture, badge + heading in the first grid cell like the official layout. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section
    class="montibello-beyond-hair__offerings"
    style="background-image: url({{ 'montibello-beyond-hair-offerings-bg.jpg' | asset_url }});"
  >
    <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-grid">
      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-badge-cell">
        <img
          src="{{ 'montibello-beyond-hair-badge.svg' | asset_url }}"
          class="montibello-beyond-hair__badge"
          width="140"
          height="140"
          loading="lazy"
          alt=""
        >
        <h2 class="montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-heading">{{ section.settings.offerings_heading | default: 'Lo que ofrecemos' }}</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar">
        <h3><span class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-number">01</span>{{ section.settings.pillar_1_title }}</h3>
        <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy">{{ section.settings.pillar_1_text }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar">
        <h3><span class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-number">02</span>{{ section.settings.pillar_2_title }}</h3>
        <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy">{{ section.settings.pillar_2_text }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar">
        <h3><span class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-number">03</span>{{ section.settings.pillar_3_title }}</h3>
        <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy">{{ section.settings.pillar_3_text }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar">
        <h3><span class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-number">04</span>{{ section.settings.pillar_4_title }}</h3>
        <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy"><p>{{ section.settings.pillar_4_text_1 }}</p><p>{{ section.settings.pillar_4_text_2 }}</p></div>
        {% if section.settings.pillar_4_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ section.settings.pillar_4_link }}" class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-cta">{{ section.settings.pillar_4_button | default: 'Ver educación' }}</a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar">
        <h3><span class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-number">05</span>{{ section.settings.pillar_5_title }}</h3>
        <div class="montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy">{{ section.settings.pillar_5_text }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<script>
  (function () {
    const root = document.currentScript.closest('.montibello-beyond-hair');
    if (!root) return;

    /* touch / keyboard: tap or Enter toggles a pillar (desktop uses hover) */
    root.querySelectorAll('.montibello-beyond-hair__pillar').forEach((pillar) => {
      pillar.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
      pillar.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
        if (event.target.closest('a')) return;
        pillar.classList.toggle('is-open');
      });
      pillar.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') {
          event.preventDefault();
          pillar.classList.toggle('is-open');
        }
      });
    });

    const hero = root.querySelector('[data-bh-video]');
    const modal = root.querySelector('[data-bh-modal]');
    const modalVideo = root.querySelector('[data-bh-modal-video]');
    if (!hero) return;

    const wide = window.matchMedia('(min-width: 750px)').matches;
    const huge = window.matchMedia('(min-width: 1700px)').matches;
    const heroSrc = !wide
      ? hero.dataset.src480
      : huge
        ? hero.dataset.src1080
        : hero.dataset.src720;
    if (heroSrc) hero.src = heroSrc;

    const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    if (reduce) {
      hero.removeAttribute('autoplay');
      hero.pause();
    } else {
      const play = hero.play();
      if (play && play.catch) play.catch(() => {});
    }

    const openBtn = root.querySelector('[data-bh-open]');
    const closeBtn = root.querySelector('[data-bh-close]');
    if (!openBtn || !modal || !modalVideo) return;

    openBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      modalVideo.src = hero.dataset.src1080 || hero.dataset.src720 || heroSrc;
      hero.pause();
      if (typeof modal.showModal === 'function') modal.showModal();
      else modal.setAttribute('open', '');
      const play = modalVideo.play();
      if (play && play.catch) play.catch(() => {});
    });

    const close = () => {
      modalVideo.pause();
      modalVideo.removeAttribute('src');
      modalVideo.load();
      if (modal.open && typeof modal.close === 'function') modal.close();
      else modal.removeAttribute('open');
      if (!reduce) {
        const play = hero.play();
        if (play && play.catch) play.catch(() => {});
      }
    };

    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);
    modal.addEventListener('cancel', (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      close();
    });
    modal.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      if (event.target === modal) close();
    });
  })();
  </script>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Measured on hair.montibello.com/beyond-hair/ (1440 / 390). */
  .montibello-beyond-hair {
    background: rgb(246, 246, 243);
    color: #000;
  }

  /* HERO — 2500:1406 background video on beige, 29px (20 mobile) below */
  .montibello-beyond-hair__hero {
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    background: rgb(246, 246, 243);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__hero {
      padding-bottom: 29px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__hero-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    /* the supplied film is 2136x1080: its own ratio shows the whole frame
       (official Vimeo is 16:9), never cropped or stretched */
    aspect-ratio: 2136 / 1080;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #d9d9d9;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__hero-video {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__play {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: calc(50% - 10px);
    z-index: 2;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.59);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    color: #fff;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 19.7px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 0.9;
    cursor: pointer;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__play:hover,
  .montibello-beyond-hair__play:focus-visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__play:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #fff;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__modal {
    width: min(92vw, calc(88vh * 16 / 9));
    max-width: 1200px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: #000;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__modal::backdrop {
    background: rgba(15, 12, 41, 0.6);
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__modal-video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1080;
    background: #000;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__modal-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: -36px;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* MANIFESTO — 50px (30 mobile) block padding, 40/40 title, 750px column */
  .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto {
    padding: 30px 15px;
    background: rgb(246, 246, 243);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto {
      padding: 50px 15px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-inner {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-heading {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 35px;
    line-height: 35px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #000;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-heading {
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 40px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-body p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 19.7px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #000;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__manifesto-closing {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 19.7px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
  }

  /* LO QUE OFRECEMOS — 5 outlined cards on the wavy-hair photo */
  .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings {
    padding: 30px 15px;
    background-color: #2a1a12;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: 50% 50%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings {
      padding: 50px 15px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 15px;
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-grid > :nth-child(4) {
      margin-top: 5px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      grid-auto-rows: 380px;
      gap: 20px 15px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-badge-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 0 0 15px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-badge-cell {
      padding: 0;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__badge {
    display: block;
    width: 201px;
    height: 196px;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 35px;
    line-height: 35px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__offerings-heading {
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 40px;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: #fff;
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar {
      padding: 50px 25px 25px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 24px;
      right: 30px;
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='9' height='9' viewBox='0 0 9 9' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M4.49512 0.5V8.5' stroke='white' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3Cpath d='M8.5 4.49609L0.5 4.49609' stroke='white' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E") no-repeat;
      transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
    }

    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar:hover::after,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar:focus-within::after,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar.is-open::after {
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='9' height='8' viewBox='0 0 9 8' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M8.5 4L0.5 4' stroke='white' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 23px;
    line-height: 21px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    opacity: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy {
    margin-top: 20px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy {
      margin-top: auto;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar:hover .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar:focus-within .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar.is-open .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 19.7px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-cta {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    border: 1px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 38px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.1s ease-in-out, background-color 0.1s ease-in-out, border-color 0.1s ease-in-out;
  }

  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-cta:hover,
  .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-cta:focus-visible {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy + .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-cta {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  }

  /* official Beyond Hair locator band: full-bleed (no beige inset), 40px of beige above,
     330px (416 mobile) tall with 12px radius — unlike the Home variant */
  .shopify-section:has(.montibello-beyond-hair) + .shopify-section:has(.montibello-destination) {
    padding: 40px 0 0;
  }

  .shopify-section:has(.montibello-beyond-hair) + .shopify-section .montibello-destination {
    min-height: 330px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .shopify-section:has(.montibello-beyond-hair) + .shopify-section .montibello-destination {
      min-height: 416px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar::after,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__pillar-copy,
    .montibello-beyond-hair__play {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Beyond Hair",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Hero" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "video_480", "label": "Vídeo hero 480p (móvil) — URL de Shopify Files", "default": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/a23239cfa2c54063b95608b071217746/a23239cfa2c54063b95608b071217746.SD-480p-1.5Mbps-96260619.mp4" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "video_720", "label": "Vídeo hero 720p (escritorio)", "default": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/a23239cfa2c54063b95608b071217746/a23239cfa2c54063b95608b071217746.HD-720p-4.5Mbps-96260619.mp4" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "video_1080", "label": "Vídeo hero 1080p (pantallas grandes y modal)", "default": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/a23239cfa2c54063b95608b071217746/a23239cfa2c54063b95608b071217746.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-96260619.mp4" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_heading", "label": "Título del hero", "default": "Beyond Hair." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "play_label", "label": "Texto del botón de vídeo", "default": "Play video" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Manifesto" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "manifesto_heading", "label": "Título", "default": "Manifesto" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "manifesto_p1", "label": "Párrafo 1", "default": "Durante más de 50 años, no solo hemos creado belleza; la hemos definido, vivido y compartido." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "manifesto_p2", "label": "Párrafo 2", "default": "Apoyamos a los salones como un verdadero aliado, ayudándolos a transformar el cabello y a dar forma a la belleza con cada gesto. Una belleza que va más allá de lo que se ve. Que inspira confianza, expresa identidad y transforma desde dentro." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "manifesto_p3", "label": "Párrafo 3", "default": "Existimos para empoderar a los peluqueros. Para ofrecerles no solo herramientas, sino la inspiración para crear sin límites. Impulsados por la naturaleza y respaldados por la ciencia, damos el poder de crear y transformar." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "manifesto_closing", "label": "Líneas finales (una por línea)", "default": "No solo somos cabello.\nSomos creatividad.\nSomos comunidad.\nSomos el futuro de una belleza sin límites.\nConstruir juntos. Crear juntos.\nMás allá del cabello. Más allá de la belleza." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Lo que ofrecemos" },
